019f2367-d8e3-72f9-85b4-5f49f077bc36	TEXT	\N	019f2367-d8e3-72f9-85b4-5f49f077bc35	Bicycles on Buses Program\n\nAll Travelbee buses are now outfitted with exterior bicycle racks. This (131) ------- has been installed to encourage our passengers to incorporate bicycle riding into their lives for transportation, exercise, and pleasure. (132) -------. Please note, however, that electric bicycles are not (133) -------. For more information on our complimentary Bicycles on Buses program, please visit www.travelbee.com/bicyclesonbuses. There you can also learn about great bicycle trails that (134) ------- accessed from our bus routes.
