019f2c3d-f3a5-79fc-a2c4-bc3a21cea6e0	TEXT	\N	019f2c3d-f3a5-79fc-a2c4-bc3a21cea6df	Popular TV Show Returns for Third Season\n\nSunday marks the start of the third season of the award-winning TV series King of the Meer. This political thriller (135) ------- on the book Whispered Illusions by Noriaki Arishima.\n\nSome reviewers of the television series believe that the third season might be even better than the previous ones. (136) ------- , other reviewers argue that the series might lose its appeal with the introduction of so many new characters, resulting in a complicated and confusing plotline.\n\nDirector Amber Randolph has responded to that (137) ------- . "The abundance of new characters can make the story challenging to follow," she said. "(138) ------- . We'll see what the fans of the show think."
