01a09645-0387-7153-b55d-e6b7c6b24694	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:38:20.429591+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff80-84c4-7808-a371-27d1f27a15b9	Phân tích đề: Metastore dùng chung, managed, Hive-compatible = Glue Data Catalog. Crawler bắt folder mới.\n(A) SAI: DynamoDB không thay Hive metastore.\n(B) ĐÚNG: Catalog là Hive metastore managed cho Athena, Redshift Spectrum, EMR, Glue jobs. Crawler định kỳ thêm partition/schema.\n(C) SAI: Named query không chia schema/partition.\n(D) SAI: Single EC2 = SPOF, vá, backup — trái managed.\n(E) SAI: RDS không phải catalog Athena/Spectrum/EMR.\nĐáp án đúng: B\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Glue Data Catalog = trung tâm schema lake. Lake Formation gắn permission lên catalog. Crawler vs partition projection (Athena) khi quá nhiều partition.	t	\N	Five analytics teams query the same S3 data lake with Amazon Athena, Amazon Redshift Spectrum and Amazon EMR. They need one Hive-compatible metastore so tables and partitions are not redefined in three places. New folders appear hourly. What should a solutions architect use?	MCQ	79	PRACTICE	\N
