01a09645-0f03-74bb-8bcd-73dbca5f6ec0	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:38:23.3745+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff80-84c4-7808-a371-27d1f27a15b9	Phân tích đề: Cluster endpoint = writer. Replica nhàn vì app không dùng reader.\n(A) SAI: Reader read-only; INSERT lỗi.\n(B) SAI: Backtrack tua cả cluster.\n(C) SAI: Replica Aurora không “convert” thành standby RDS cổ điển.\n(D) SAI: Pause giết writer.\n(E) ĐÚNG: Tách ghi → cluster, đọc lệch → reader. Custom endpoint nếu sau này tách BI/API.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: cluster = writer · reader = mọi replica · custom = subset. Replica “không chịu tải” thường là sai endpoint.	t	\N	A point-of-sale Aurora MySQL cluster shows the writer at 82 percent CPU and three replicas idle at ~10 percent. Performance Insights attributes the writer load to identical store-dashboard SELECTs that tolerate ~80 ms of lag. The app’s only connection string is the cluster endpoint. What should a solutions architect do first?	MCQ	239	PRACTICE	\N
