01a09645-1760-786c-acc8-cfaa18e09eb6	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:38:25.519944+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff80-84c4-7808-a371-27d1f27a15b9	Phân tích đề: <1 s + nhiều consumer + custom app = Data Streams, không Firehose (đệm ~60s+).\n(A) SAI: Firehose buffer, không API live <1 s cho bốn team.\n(B) SAI: Glue = ETL batch.\n(C) ĐÚNG: Streams độ trễ hàng trăm ms. EFO nếu bốn consumer × 2 MB/s vượt shared read.\n(D) SAI: S3 event không stream ordered multi-consumer.\n(E) SAI: Delay 60 s phá SLA giây.\nĐáp án đúng: C\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Streams = realtime, retention, replay. Firehose = delivery, đệm, không replay. Đề <1 s / fan-out → Streams.	t	\N	Fraud features must score each event in under a second. Four independent consumers will read the live stream. Buffering of 60–120 seconds is not acceptable, and the team will keep a custom consumer. Which ingest service should a solutions architect choose?	MCQ	335	PRACTICE	\N
01a09645-177a-75c7-afb8-0c5f5195d7fc	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:38:25.546298+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff80-84c4-7808-a371-27d1f27a15b9	Phân tích đề: Sáu × 2 MB/s trên cùng shard phá shared 2 MB/s. Cần EFO.\n(A) SAI: FIFO = một consumer group hiệu dụng.\n(B) SAI: Firehose không sáu reader realtime.\n(C) ĐÚNG: SubscribeToShard HTTP/2: 2 MB/s riêng / consumer, không trừ quota GetRecords.\n(D) SAI: Backoff làm chậm hơn.\n(E) SAI: Retention = replay, không tăng read live.\nĐáp án đúng: C\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Shared GetRecords 2 MB/s/shard. EFO khi nhiều consumer realtime. On-demand là chiều ghi.	t	\N	Six downstream applications each need a live 2 MB/s view of the same shard. Shared GetRecords consumers already fall behind. What should a solutions architect enable?	MCQ	336	PRACTICE	\N
