01a09641-462c-746d-8053-39b88d1501f8	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:34:15.358466+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Đây timeout quá dài sau crash — cùng lời giải, góc crash chậm retry.\n(A) ĐÚNG: Visibility ngắn = crash → hiện lại ~30s. Job khoẻ gia hạn visibility. Xoá khi xong.\n(B) SAI: 10s < 3 phút → duplicate job khoẻ.\n(C) SAI: Xoá lúc nhận = mất job khi crash.\n(D) SAI: FIFO high throughput không bỏ visibility.\n(E) SAI: CLB idle ≠ SQS visibility.\nĐáp án đúng: A\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Visibility quá dài = retry chậm. Quá ngắn = double work. Heartbeat = cả hai.	t	\N	A worker crashes at minute 2 of a 3-minute job. Visibility timeout is 10 minutes, so the message stays invisible until minute 10 before another worker starts. Product wants crash retries in about 30 seconds, but a healthy 3-minute job must not be handed to a second worker. What should a solutions architect implement?	MCQ	302	PRACTICE	\N
