01a09641-4b15-7623-8994-e436a028a152	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:34:16.612904+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Access point = enforce root subdirectory + POSIX identity cho NFS/Lambda/ECS.\n(A) ĐÚNG: Access point: path=/team-a, uid 1001, gid 1001. Task mount AP, không thấy cây khác (nếu quyền đúng).\n(B) SAI: Scratch không phải jail POSIX đa team.\n(C) SAI: CLB không map uid.\n(D) SAI: EBS không share đa AZ/team.\n(E) SAI: One Zone không phải isolation team.\nĐáp án đúng: A\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Access point = “IAM + POSIX gate”. Lambda/ECS nên mount qua AP. Vẫn cần SG + IAM policy (elasticfilesystem:ClientMount).	t	\N	Several application teams share one Regional EFS. Each team must mount a directory jail with a fixed POSIX uid/gid so containers cannot write another team’s tree, without teaching every task to run chown. What should a solutions architect create?	MCQ	351	PRACTICE	\N
