01a09658-b401-7de6-b8a2-ff52ef147aa5	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:50.793308+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Task retirement là bảo trì platform. Cần EventBridge + deploy chủ động, không đợi SIGTERM bất ngờ.\n(A) SAI: AWS có retire task Fargate/EC2.\n(B) SAI: Classic không gia hạn retirement.\n(C) SAI: Desired 0 = tự outage.\n(D) SAI: RECREATE đúng giờ retire = outage có chủ đích.\n(E) ĐÚNG: Event ECS Task State Change / retirement notifications. Force new deployment trước deadline → rolling, ALB không tụt đột ngột.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Retirement ≠ deploy hỏng. Lắng nghe EventBridge/Health, roll trước hạn. Giống AMI retirement trên ASG (refresh), nhưng đây là task.	t	\N	AWS notified that a Fargate platform revision will retire tasks next week. Last time nobody watched email; retired tasks vanished during lunch and the ALB served 503 until ECS launched replacements reactively. Leadership wants controlled replacement before the deadline. What should a solutions architect do?	MCQ	148	PRACTICE	\N
01a09658-b40f-7522-85cf-efc4ec15af0c	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:50.809959+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Spread chỉ AZ = sáu task / hai máy (mỗi AZ một máy lớn). Panic hai kernel = hết service. Cần spread instanceId.\n(A) SAI: Một task = SPOF.\n(B) SAI: Binpack nhồi — đúng ngược.\n(C) SAI: Classic không đặt task.\n(D) SAI: Cluster placement tăng correlated failure.\n(E) ĐÚNG: Strategy list: spread AZ rồi spread instanceId (hoặc attribute:ecs.instance-id). Task mới tránh chồng host.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Spread AZ ≠ spread host. License/seat = distinctInstance. HA API = AZ + instanceId. AZ rebalancing sửa fleet cũ.	t	\N	An ECS service on EC2 uses placement strategy spread on ecs.availability-zone. All six tasks still land on two large instances in different AZs because those hosts have free memory; the other ten instances are idle. A kernel panic on those two hosts removed every task. The team wants the next launches to prefer different container instances as well as AZs. What should a solutions architect add?	MCQ	149	PRACTICE	\N
