01a09658-b452-76ab-91e8-892e6af16bd6	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:50.878476+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Đây = process treo (không exit) → cần healthCheck trong task.\n(A) SAI: TCP giấu deadlock.\n(B) SAI: Classic không thay task ECS.\n(C) SAI: Không essential = zombie.\n(D) SAI: Một task = SPOF.\n(E) ĐÚNG: healthCheck.command trong container. Fail → container (essential) unhealthy → task thay. Nhanh hơn ALB 2,5 phút.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: ALB health = bớt traffic. ECS container healthCheck = thay task. essential exit = process chết. Ba lớp.	t	\N	The ALB health interval is 30 seconds (threshold 5) — a deadlocked JVM can sit in rotation for more than two minutes. The task definition has no container healthCheck. Product wants ECS to replace the task as soon as the process fails its own liveness probe, even if the ALB has not yet flipped. What should a solutions architect add?	MCQ	153	PRACTICE	\N
01a09658-b468-7f18-a7c4-0fd862fbd879	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:50.899552+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Health liveness ≠ business 5xx. Cần alarm CodeDeploy (bake/canary).\n(A) SAI: Tắt /ready làm mọi target unhealthy.\n(B) SAI: Min 0 = được phép về 0.\n(C) SAI: Log tuần không rollback.\n(D) SAI: Circuit breaker là rolling ECS, không điều khiển listener CodeDeploy.\n(E) ĐÚNG: Deployment group CloudWatch alarms. 5xx ALARM → CodeDeploy reroute về blue.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: /ready nông + canary không alarm = 5xx im lặng. Gắn metric nghiệp vụ vào CodeDeploy. Circuit breaker ≠ CodeDeploy rollback.	t	\N	CodeDeploy already shifts ECS blue/green in a canary. Green passed target-group health but returned HTTP 500 on checkout for eight minutes before anyone noticed. Target health stayed green because /ready does not touch the database. What should a solutions architect attach to the CodeDeploy deployment group?	MCQ	154	PRACTICE	\N
01a09658-b47c-77c3-9867-129554f81b83	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:50.921348+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Đây nhấn retry đa AZ, không ALB nội bộ.\n(A) SAI: TTL dài kéo dài stale.\n(B) SAI: Một task = SPOF.\n(C) SAI: Hardcode IP hỏng ngay khi task/instance bị thay — phải dùng tên dịch vụ.\n(D) ĐÚNG: Service Connect: proxy sidecar, outlier/retry, không phụ thuộc TTL client. Task chết → hết connection mới ngay.\n(E) SAI: Classic + TTL dài = tệ hơn.\nĐáp án đúng: D\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Cloud Map DNS vẫn bị cache. Mesh/Service Connect = lớp kết nối. ALB vẫn đúng khi cần L7 công khai.	t	\N	Twelve Fargate services already resolve each other through Cloud Map DNS. Clients still hammer a task for the full TTL after it fails because they cache the A record. The team rejected “an ALB per service.” They want the data-plane proxy to stop sending to that task immediately and to retry another task in a second AZ. What should a solutions architect adopt?	MCQ	155	PRACTICE	\N
