01a09658-c721-7528-977c-a3ef6aaff407	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:55.702461+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Hai container song song; app sẵn trước proxy → ALB vào app lộ. Cần thứ tự + HEALTHY.\n(A) SAI: Grace 0 + một task = tệ hơn.\n(B) ĐÚNG: dependsOn + condition: HEALTHY (sidecar phải có healthCheck). App chưa start → task chưa ready → ALB chưa đưa vào rotation.\n(C) SAI: App không essential = JVM chết mà task vẫn RUNNING.\n(D) SAI: Fargate không dùng target instance.\n(E) SAI: Classic không thay sidecar.\nĐáp án đúng: B\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Sidecar proxy → dependsOn HEALTHY, không chỉ START/COMPLETE. ALB health sau khi task RUNNING — quá muộn nếu app đã nghe port.	t	\N	A ferry-booking task runs an Envoy sidecar and a Spring app in the same Fargate task. The app container has no dependsOn. During rolling deploys the app accepts ALB traffic for ~8 seconds before Envoy binds 8080; clients see connection resets and the circuit breaker flaps. What should a solutions architect add to the task definition?	MCQ	369	PRACTICE	\N
