01a09658-c75b-76fd-a70a-f1a93dbbd9b8	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:55.76039+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Instance sắp chết vẫn nhận task mới. Cần DRAINING trước khi ASG terminate.\n(A) ĐÚNG: Managed draining: instance DRAINING → task không place mới, task cũ dừng có stopTimeout, rồi scale-in host.\n(B) SAI: Pin host = mất HA.\n(C) SAI: Min 0 cho phép outage.\n(D) SAI: DAEMON + 1 = SPOF.\n(E) SAI: Classic không drain ECS.\nĐáp án đúng: A\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Managed scaling ≠ managed draining. Không drain = task mới đáp xuống máy sắp chết. DRAINING = stop + stopTimeout, không còn placement.	t	\N	Landfill truck-scale software runs as ECS on EC2. Capacity-provider managed scaling launched a replacement instance for a bad host, but ECS placed new tasks on the dying instance until it hard-failed; in-flight weighments dropped. Managed draining is off. What should a solutions architect enable?	MCQ	371	PRACTICE	\N
01a09658-c778-7f48-a07a-2d330564840b	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-12 15:59:55.786202+00	db7b9178-e89f-40f6-a927-ffbad8114857	019eff7c-f11f-78ff-a988-2388bf3d96bb	Phân tích đề: Pin cũ = AWS bắt stop khi hết hỗ trợ. Cần tự roll trước.\n(A) SAI: Breaker không chặn retirement.\n(B) SAI: DAEMON không phải Fargate.\n(C) SAI: Classic không ghim platform.\n(D) SAI: Desired 0 = tự gây outage.\n(E) ĐÚNG: Đổi platform version trên service/task definition, deploy có minHealthyPercent / CodeDeploy. Task mới trên platform mới; cũ drain.\nĐáp án đúng: E\nĐiểm cần nhớ: Pin platform = bạn chịu lịch retire. LATEST + deploy có kiểm soát vẫn hơn bị AWS hốt hàng loạt. Theo EventBridge ECS Task State Change / Health Dashboard.	t	\N	An observatory photometry API pins Fargate platform version 1.3.0 in the service. AWS mailed that this revision retires next week. Last retirement, pinned tasks vanished in a 12-minute burst and the ALB served 503. The team wants a controlled roll onto a supported platform without waiting for the hard stop. What should a solutions architect do?	MCQ	372	PRACTICE	\N
